{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09257","headline":"月晦忆去年与亲友曲水游讌 · 韦应物","name":"月晦忆去年与亲友曲水游讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晦赏念前岁，京国结良俦。\n骑出宣平里，饮对曲池流。\n今朝隔天末，空园伤独游。\n雨歇林光变，塘緑鸟声幽。\n凋甿积逋税，华鬓集新秋。\n谁言恋虎符，终当还旧丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}